  {
   "id": "overland-16607@post-2020-03-04",
   "gameId": "overland-16607",
   "displayName": "Build 751 - The Little Things",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2020-03-04T15:32:45.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Since the last patch notes, we've added a bunch of little things to improve the overall feel of the game, including:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hint outlines to help new players find good scavenging spots",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Organize window can support Large UI mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved vista rendering performance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Streamlined some campfire/map transitions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some glitches in the vehicle animations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some mouse UI stuff",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "And a handful of fiddly other bits. I think this is the last v1.1 patch - we're already working on v1.2, so it's gonna be a while before another update drops here. I'm really excited about the stuff we're adding, but localizing into almost 20 languages means it might be a bit of a wait, so thanks in advance for your patience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
