  {
   "id": "overland-16607@post-2020-02-14",
   "gameId": "overland-16607",
   "displayName": "Build 742 - Pat Buffs + Audio/UI Fixes",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2020-02-14T20:15:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Rebalancing a live game can be a really controversial process but I'm really excited to share with you all that patting dogs now costs zero action points. I think this is a game changer for our competitive players and I'm excited to see what they do with this buff. Other changes include:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "new quicksand crater visuals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "changed inspect and organize to have full black backgrounds",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "added 0.1s show/hide fades to a lot of the level UI elements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "adjusted the timing of title screen and level exit fades",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "boatloads of overdue audio fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I know I keep saying this is the last one before we buckle down to start work on the bigger update but I keep finding things from the bigger update that is fun to share earlier. We'll probably have another patch next week too! Thanks and have a good weekend?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
    "new": 2,
